<title>USA: Eljer unit files 3rd amended Chapter 11 plan.</title>
<headline>Eljer unit files 3rd amended Chapter 11 plan.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eljer Industries Inc said Monday that its subsidiary, United States Brass Corp, had filed its third amended plan of reorganization in its Chapter 11 bankruptcy case.</p>
</text>
